title: "An uncomputable noise diagram on the line and a finite-energy Gibbs diagram on the square lattice"
version: 2.1.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24147268"
date-released: '2026-11-20'
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Douglas
